  "limits": [
    "Reference compiles unchanged IsDisabledSound and I_PCS_GetSfxLumpNum from pinned Chocolate Doom with original id sound names/enums. It does not infer sampled-sound aliases.",
    "Both official Freedoom phases are checked across all109 effect IDs. Missing clips and deliberately disabled effects remain silent; malformed present clips throw before publishing cache state.",
    "Twenty-four exceptional paths cover invalid owners, bank allocation failure, clip read/allocate failures, malformed headers, cleanup and retry. Repeated requests perform no WAD reads; complete teardown restores the task heap.",
    "Actor/sector selection, spatial audibility, channel priority and actual Play ownership remain separate implementation work.",
    "Native chaingun weapon action already requests pistol directly. Unused chgun metadata resolves its own DPCHGUN name, as the pinned PC driver does."
  ]
